    "description": "Advanced animation tools for manipulating animation relative to screen space, including the ability to switch spaces to/from local space and screen space for almost any control.\n\n* Quickly edit your animation of one or many controls in screen space.\n* Animation becomes relative to the camera, using x-horizontal, y-vertical and depth-(distance to camera) curves.\n* Great for animating flying objects, or finding depth bumps in object tracks.\n* Animator friendly, have the choice to use only your existing keyframes.\n* Matchmove friendly, have the choice to bake all keys.\n* Can be used in many more creative ways.",
